:: Carter House Arriving Weekday [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $HangOutNeed to {
    Energy: 100,
    Fun: 20,
    Comfort: 20,
}>>
You ring the doorbell at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s house and wait a few moments before his older brother, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, opens the door. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>. Nice to see you.”</span> He says, as you hear a sudden shuffle from inside. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>?”</span> He opens the door further to reveal <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, lying on the couch with a comic in his hand. <span style="Color: LightGreen">He had popped up upon hearing your name.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“$CarterNickname!”</span> He says happily, trying to scramble to his feet before suddenly falling to the floor and having to get back up with a flushed face. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“H- hey! What are you doing here? Did you want to hang out or-?”</span> He asks, looking hopeful. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask to go somewhere<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if he wants to go hangout somewhere in town and he quickly pops up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! Of course!”</span> He replies before suddenly freezing and glancing up at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Umm, I mean… Can I pretty please go play with my friend, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, coolest and bestest brother in the world who is in charge while mom and dad are at work?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color: Pink">puts on his cutest smile and pleading eyes, which you try to mimic to aid him in getting permission.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
        /*Callum later once his avatar is added. */

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure, sure.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> laughs, ruffling his brother’s hair, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But you know the rules, right?”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yup! Back before dark, no downtown, and call if anything comes up!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> replies happily. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And?”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tilts his head in confusion before suddenly realizing, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! And no going anywhere with strangers, even if they need help. All good deeds will be done in the safety and view of the public!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> salutes as you raise an eyebrow at that last rule. You guess it’s something his family would want to drill into him, due to his nature to help first and ask questions later. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, have fun!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> says. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> quickly returns to his room to put his comic away and grab anything he needs. The two of you then head off. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, where did you want to go?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> asks. <br>
        <br>
        
