        You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if it would be alright if the two of you hung out here and the boy instantly perks up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! Of course!”</span> He replies before suddenly freezing and glancing up at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Umm, I mean… Can I pretty please go play with my friend, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, coolest and bestest brother in the world who is in charge while mom and dad are at work?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color: Pink">puts on his cutest smile and pleading eyes, which you try to mimic to aid him in getting permission.</span> <br>

