        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure, sure.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> laughs, ruffling his brother’s hair, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just try not to be too crazy, alright? And you still have to get your homework and chores done before bed. Got it?”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yup!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> replies with a smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>, you’re the best!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s what they say.”</span> He laughs, heading back to his room as the two of you walk into the living room. <br>
